lass="[overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap">this images are having issues fitting and showing very on mobile, what can we do about it</div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="Your message actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy message" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Edit message" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="6d6a4db5-c2ec-4d88-a880-eff6708e0303" data-testid="conversation-turn-57" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="7bd640ed-86fe-4f04-9b71-7b2a8baa2b62" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="168">Yes. The issue is normal because these hero images are <strong data-start="55" data-end="79">wide desktop banners</strong>. On mobile, <code data-start="92" data-end="116">background-size: cover</code> crops them, while <code data-start="135" data-end="144">contain</code> shows blank top/bottom.</p>
<p data-start="170" data-end="223">Best fix: use <strong data-start="184" data-end="222">separate desktop and mobile images</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="225" data-end="247">For each hero, create:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="249" data-end="343"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>hero-01-dark.png</span><br><span>hero-01-light.png</span><br><span>hero-01-mobile-dark.png</span><br><span>hero-01-mobile-light.png</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="345" data-end="444">Mobile image should be <strong data-start="368" data-end="390">portrait or square</strong>, with the main object centered higher, not far right.</p>
<p data-start="446" data-end="460">CSS structure:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="462" data-end="1182"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>.</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>  background-image: </span><span class="ͼn">var</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼt">--hero-desktop</span><span>);</span><br><span>  background-size: </span><span class="ͼq">cover</span><span>;</span><br><span>  background-position: </span><span class="ͼq">center</span><span> </span><span class="ͼq">right</span><span>;</span><br><span>  background-repeat: </span><span class="ͼq">no-repeat</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>[</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'light'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼt">--hero-desktop</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼq">url</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼr">'/images/landing/hero-01-light.png'</span><span>);</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span>[</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'dark'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼt">--hero-desktop</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼq">url</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼr">'/images/landing/hero-01-dark.png'</span><span>);</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼn">@media</span><span> (max-width: </span><span class="ͼq">768</span><span class="ͼn">px</span><span>) {</span><br><span>  .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>    background-image: </span><span class="ͼn">var</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼt">--hero-mobile</span><span>);</span><br><span>    background-size: </span><span class="ͼq">cover</span><span>;</span><br><span>    background-position: </span><span class="ͼq">center</span><span> </span><span class="ͼq">top</span><span>;</span><br><span>    min-height: </span><span class="ͼq">100</span><span class="ͼn">svh</span><span>;</span><br><span>  }</span><br><br><span>  [</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'light'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼt">--hero-mobile</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼq">url</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼr">'/images/landing/hero-01-mobile-light.png'</span><span>);</span><br><span>  }</span><br><br><span>  [</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'dark'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼt">--hero-mobile</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼq">url</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼr">'/images/landing/hero-01-mobile-dark.png'</span><span>);</span><br><span>  }</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1184" data-end="1310">Important: don’t use the same 16:9 image for mobile. Generate/crop a <strong data-start="1253" data-end="1271">mobile version</strong> around <strong data-start="1279" data-end="1292">1080×1600</strong> or <strong data-start="1296" data-end="1309">1440×1920</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="1312" data-end="1344">Also add a soft overlay in code:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1346" data-end="1570"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>.</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span>::</span><span class="ͼs">before</span><span> {</span><br><span>  content: </span><span class="ͼr">''</span><span>;</span><br><span>  position: </span><span class="ͼq">absolute</span><span>;</span><br><span>  inset: </span><span class="ͼq">0</span><span>;</span><br><span>  background: </span><span class="ͼn">linear-gradient</span><span>(</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼq">90</span><span class="ͼn">deg</span><span>,</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">2</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">8</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">23</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">0.82</span><span>),</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">2</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">8</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">23</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">0.35</span><span>),</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">2</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">8</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">23</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">0.1</span><span>)</span><br><span>  );</span><br><span>  pointer-events: </span><span class="ͼq">none</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1572" data-end="1588">For light theme:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1590" data-end="1769"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>[</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'light'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span>::</span><span class="ͼs">before</span><span> {</span><br><span>  background: </span><span class="ͼn">linear-gradient</span><span>(</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼq">90</span><span class="ͼn">deg</span><span>,</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">0.88</span><span>),</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">0.45</span><span>),</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">0.12</span><span>)</span><br><span>  );</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1771" data-end="1897" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">So the real solution is: <strong data-start="1796" data-end="1897" data-is-last-node="">desktop image for desktop, mobile image for mobile, overlay handled by CSS, not inside the image.</strong></p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Share" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#630ca2" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><span class="" data-sta