s="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Edit message" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="d2de1d54-3cad-431b-a9af-8e9b3b840cbb" data-testid="conversation-turn-59" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="494443cf-acff-4b9c-9962-d4eda6b512b6" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="153">Right now your problem isn’t CSS—it’s <strong data-start="38" data-end="56">asset strategy</strong>.<br data-start="57" data-end="60">
You’re trying to force one wide, detailed image to behave like a responsive system. It won’t.</p>
<p data-start="155" data-end="225">So here’s exactly what you do, step by step (clean, production-ready):</p>
<hr data-start="227" data-end="230">
<h2 data-section-id="n75bw4" data-start="232" data-end="284">🔥 1. Split your hero into TWO assets (mandatory)</h2>
<p data-start="286" data-end="300">For each hero:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="vjjbj4" data-start="302" data-end="337">Desktop (what you already have)</h3>
<ul data-start="338" data-end="416">
<li data-section-id="1awtpwt" data-start="338" data-end="360">
<p data-start="340" data-end="360">1920×1080 (or wider)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="mnutrf" data-start="361" data-end="387">
<p data-start="363" data-end="387">Subject pushed <strong data-start="378" data-end="387">right</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4p41nq" data-start="388" data-end="416">
<p data-start="390" data-end="416">Left side = empty for text</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1ur2om1" data-start="418" data-end="451">Mobile (you MUST create this)</h3>
<ul data-start="452" data-end="616">
<li data-section-id="ef59o3" data-start="452" data-end="476">
<p data-start="454" data-end="476">1080×1600 or 1440×1800</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="s6vvcz" data-start="477" data-end="501">
<p data-start="479" data-end="501">Subject = <strong data-start="489" data-end="501">centered</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pjv4g6" data-start="502" data-end="523">
<p data-start="504" data-end="523">Remove tiny details</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ampvd1" data-start="524" data-end="581">
<p data-start="526" data-end="536">Keep only:</p>
<ul data-start="539" data-end="581">
<li data-section-id="r76tky" data-start="539" data-end="559">
<p data-start="541" data-end="559">logo / core object</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ksjvne" data-start="562" data-end="581">
<p data-start="564" data-end="581">glow / background</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="kifo8j" data-start="582" data-end="616">
<p data-start="584" data-end="616">No small icons, no bottom strips</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="618" data-end="656">👉 This alone fixes 80% of your issue.</p>
<hr data-start="658" data-end="661">
<h2 data-section-id="e0fizs" data-start="663" data-end="708">🎯 2. Structure your React / CSS correctly</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1xxfesn" data-start="710" data-end="717">JSX</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="718" data-end="915"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼv">&lt;section</span><span> </span><span class="ͼu">className</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">"hero"</span><span class="ͼv">&gt;</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼv">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼu">className</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">"hero-content"</span><span class="ͼv">&gt;</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼv">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span>Fin Freedom Network</span><span class="ͼv">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼv">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>Wallet-first participation...</span><span class="ͼv">&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼv">&lt;button&gt;</span><span>Get Started</span><span class="ͼv">&lt;/button&gt;</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼv">&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼv">&lt;/section&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="917" data-end="920">
<h2 data-section-id="50qqz2" data-start="922" data-end="971">🎨 3. Background system (this is the real fix)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="973" data-end="1381"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>.</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>  position: </span><span class="ͼq">relative</span><span>;</span><br><span>  min-height: </span><span class="ͼq">100</span><span class="ͼn">vh</span><span>;</span><br><span>  display: </span><span class="ͼq">flex</span><span>;</span><br><span>  align-items: </span><span class="ͼq">center</span><span>;</span><br><br><span>  background-size: </span><span class="ͼq">cover</span><span>;</span><br><span>  background-repeat: </span><span class="ͼq">no-repeat</span><span>;</span><br><span>  background-position: </span><span class="ͼq">right</span><span> </span><span class="ͼq">center</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼl">/* DARK DESKTOP */</span><br><span>[</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'dark'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>  background-image: </span><span class="ͼq">url</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼr">'/images/hero-01-dark.png'</span><span>);</span><br><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼl">/* LIGHT DESKTOP */</span><br><span>[</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'light'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>  background-image: </span><span class="ͼq">url</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼr">'/images/hero-01-light.png'</span><span>);</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1383" data-end="1386">
<h2 data-section-id="1vopupl" data-start="1388" data-end="1442">📱 4. MOBILE override (THIS is what you’re missing)</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1444" data-end="1731"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼn">@media</span><span> (max-width: </span><span class="ͼq">768</span><span class="ͼn">px</span><span>) {</span><br><span>  .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>    background-position: </span><span class="ͼq">center</span><span> </span><span class="ͼq">top</span><span>;</span><br><span>  }</span><br><br><span>  [</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'dark'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>    background-image: </span><span class="ͼq">url</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼr">'/images/hero-01-mobile-dark.png'</span><span>);</span><br><span>  }</span><br><br><span>  [</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'light'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span> {</span><br><span>    background-image: </span><span class="ͼq">url</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼr">'/images/hero-01-mobile-light.png'</span><span>);</span><br><span>  }</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1733" data-end="1736">
<h2 data-section-id="13z4ntz" data-start="1738" data-end="1778">⚡ 5. Fix readability (VERY important)</h2>
<p data-start="1780" data-end="1838">Instead of baking gradients into the image → do it in CSS:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1840" data-end="2032"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>.</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span>::</span><span class="ͼs">before</span><span> {</span><br><span>  content: </span><span class="ͼr">''</span><span>;</span><br><span>  position: </span><span class="ͼq">absolute</span><span>;</span><br><span>  inset: </span><span class="ͼq">0</span><span>;</span><br><br><span>  background: </span><span class="ͼn">linear-gradient</span><span>(</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼq">90</span><span class="ͼn">deg</span><span>,</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">2</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">6</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">23</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">0.85</span><span>),</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">2</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">6</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">23</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼq">0.4</span><span>),</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼq">transparent</span><br><span>  );</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2034" data-end="2046">Light theme:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2048" data-end="2214"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼk ͼy"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>[</span><span class="ͼu">data-theme</span><span class="ͼn">=</span><span class="ͼr">'light'</span><span>] .</span><span class="ͼs">hero</span><span>::</span><span class="ͼs">before</span><span> {</span><br><span>  background: </span><span class="ͼn">linear-gradient</span><span>(</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼq">90</span><span class="ͼn">deg</span><span>,</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">0.9</span><span>),</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼn">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼq">0.5</span><span>),</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼq">transparent</span><br><span>  );</span><br><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="2216" data-end="2219">
<h2 data-section-id="1nrqdf" data-start="2221" data-end="2259">🧠 6. The REAL rule you must follow</h2>
<p data-start="2261" data-end="2277">Stop doing this:</p>
<blockquote data-start="2278" data-end="2306">
<p data-start="2280" data-end="2306">"One image for everything"</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="2308" data-end="2325">Start doing this:</p>
<blockquote data-start="2326" data-end="2365">
<p data-start="2328" data-end="2365">"Each screen has its own composition"</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="2367" data-end="2370">
<h2 data-section-id="g6cv8x" data-start="2372" data-end="2405">🎯 7. For YOUR specific images</h2>
<p data-start="2407" data-end="2434">For the ones you generated:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="72qe9z" data-start="2436" data-end="2445">KEEP:</h3>
<ul data-start="2446" data-end="2509">
<li data-section-id="e9yig4" data-start="2446" data-end="2481">
<p data-start="2448" data-end="2481">Right-side emblem / coin / shield</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1n7dldw" data-start="2482" data-end="2509">
<p data-start="2484" data-end="2509">Glow / network background</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="rq8uw0" data-start="2511" data-end="2535">REMOVE (for mobile):</h3>
<ul data-start="2536" data-end="2584">
<li data-section-id="11ryfz3" data-start="2536" data-end="2550">
<p data-start="2538" data-end="2550">Bottom icons</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qln4oc" data-start="2551" data-end="2563">
<p data-start="2553" data-end="2563">Tiny texts</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18wfmf3" data-start="2564" data-end="2584">
<p data-start="2566" data-end="2584">Horizontal layouts</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="1dafuwi" data-start="2586" data-end="2601">REPOSITION:</h3>
<ul data-start="2602" data-end="2659">
<li data-section-id="ndnqy0" data-start="2602" data-end="2631">
<p data-start="2604" data-end="2631">Move subject <strong data-start="2617" data-end="2631">center-top</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lv6smh" data-start="2632" data-end="2659">
<p data-start="2634" data-end="2659">Leave space below for CTA</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2661" data-end="2664">
<h2 data-section-id="zkl7qw" data-start="2666" data-end="2683">🚀 If you want</h2>
<p data-start="2685" data-end="2691">I can:</p>
<ul data-start="2692" data-end="2818">
<li data-section-id="1y88zle" data-start="2692" data-end="2725">
<p data-start="2694" data-end="2725">Take ONE of your current images</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ucziih" data-start="2726" data-end="2818">
<p data-start="2728" data-end="2745">Redesign it into:</p>
<ul data-start="2748" data-end="2818">
<li data-section-id="7h5af9" data-start="2748" data-end="2767">
<p data-start="2750" data-end="2767">✅ Desktop version</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="nahyqf" data-start="2770" data-end="2788">
<p data-start="2772" data-end="2788">✅ Mobile version</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1c7ydpu" data-start="2791" data-end="2818">
<p data-start="2793" data-end="2818">✅ Perfect spacing for CTA</p>
</li>
</ul>
